              "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250",
              "source": "UniProtKB",
              "id": "O50330"
            },
            {
              "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
              "source": "PubMed",
              "id": "11988518"
            }
          ],
          "value": "The core secretion machinery of the VirB/VirD4 T4SS is composed of cytoplasmic ATPases that form the energy center, an inner membrane complex (IMC), an outer membrane core complex (OMCC) and a stalk (or cylinder) that connects the IMC and the OMCC (By similarity). This subunit either functions as a multimer or interacts with some other component(s) necessary for intracellular replication (PubMed:11988518)"
        }
      ],
      "commentType": "SUBUNIT"
    },
    {
      "commentType": "SUBCELLULAR LOCATION",
